# M051 (Logto cluster): LAN reverse-proxy zones for Logto behind D048's
# local CA. Loaded into the existing nautilo-cert-guard Caddy alongside
# `server.nautilo.local`.
#
# These zones only matter for LAN deployments (D048). Dev mode hits
# Logto on `http://localhost:3301` directly. Managed SaaS terminates
# TLS at Cloud Run / Cloudflare and bypasses Caddy entirely.
#
# Hostname registration: the nautilo-cert-guard SAN list (D048 Phase 2)
# must include `auth.nautilo.local` and `auth-admin.nautilo.local` for
# the issued cert to cover these zones. If D048 hard-codes the SAN list,
# add the two new hostnames there; if it generalizes hostname → cert
# mapping (it does as of D048 Phase 3), no code change needed.

auth.nautilo.local:443 {
    tls /certs/local-ca.crt /certs/local-ca.key
    reverse_proxy logto:3301
}

auth-admin.nautilo.local:443 {
    tls /certs/local-ca.crt /certs/local-ca.key
    reverse_proxy logto:3302
}
